	(text "Pin-out (same on every slot, approved 2026-09-26)\n1 to 19: row b RF zone: b1 GND, b2+b3 RF1, b4 GND, b5+b6 RF2, b7 GND, b8+b9 RF3, b10 GND,\n  b11+b12 RF4, b13 GND, b14+b15 RF5, b16 GND, b17+b18 RF6, b19 GND. Rows a and c: GND.\n20: GND.  21: SDA / GND / SCL.  22: ~INT / GND / ~RLY_EN.  23: PTT1 / GND / PTT2.  24: PTT3 / GND / PTT4.\n25: SLOT_ID0 / SLOT_ID1 / SLOT_ID2.  26: SLOT_ID3 / GND / TX_ANY.  27: +12V_AUX / GND / SPARE2.\n28: GND.  29: +5V / GND / +5V.  30: GND.  31: +12V_RLY / GND / +12V_RLY.  32: GND.\nSlot order: Link, R1 to R4, A1 to A6. ANTk runs from the radio slots to slot Ak only (no stub).\nRX-only line (LoG) on A6, furthest from the TX lines."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "08efceaf-5355-4f4c-b1cd-2e30339de5e8")
	)
	(text "Chassis bond: the mounting holes are not grounded (no ground loops).\nH1 is the only plated hole (net CHASSIS). JP1 open and C1 not fitted by default.\nClose JP1 for a DC bond, or fit C1 for an RF-only bond."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 106.68 0)
		(effects
